; The one variable: a host heading whose `%Name` walk leaves the instance. `HudInstance/%Lamp`
; names a node of the host that the instance's owner table holds, so Godot seats Shade under
; Lamp, up and to the right of the origin, not under the instance. No other golden seats a
; heading outside the instance it walked into.

